OL,3,GNEWSACharity says action needed to help
OL,4,A'starving' sheep on remote islands
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Scottish animal welfare charity says
OL,7,F"meaningful action" is needed to
OL,8,Fprotect a rare breed of sheep in the
OL,9,FOuter Hebrides from starvation.
OL,11,FSoay and Boreray roam wild on St Kilda
OL,12,Fand are descended from animals first
OL,13,Fbrought to the remote archipelago
OL,14,Fthousands of years ago.
OL,16,FThere have been calls for their numbers
OL,17,Fto be controlled due to a lack of
OL,18,Favailable grazing in winter.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
