OL,3,GNEWSACharity says action needed to help
OL,4,A'starving' sheep on remote islands
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnimal Concern, which is holding a
OL,7,Fpublic event in Glasgow next month to
OL,8,Fraise awareness of the sheep, said
OL,9,Fintervention was needed due to
OL,10,F"recurring welfare concerns".
